{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-p028a","title":"《江表传》载刘备会周瑜并观望","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-p028a-account","label":"《江表传》","text":"《江表传》记刘备在樊口等待吴军，乘单舸见周瑜；称其未信三万人足胜，后与关羽、张飞率二千人观望，孙盛对此质疑。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-p028a-q"]},{"id":"xianzhu-a-p028-sunsheng","label":"孙盛评论","text":"孙盛认为刘备告急而获吴援，无缘复怀后计，判断此为吴人专美之辞。","evidence":["xianzhu-q-p028-sunsheng"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-bei","role":"会周瑜","evidence":["xianzhu-e-p028a-q"]},{"person":"zhou-yu","role":"会谈","evidence":["xianzhu-e-p028a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0172","role":"随军","evidence":["xianzhu-e-p028a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0367","role":"随军","evidence":["xianzhu-e-p028a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"鄂县樊口","evidence":["xianzhu-e-p028a-q"]},"time":{"year":208,"label":"赤壁交战前","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xianzhu-y208","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xianzhu-q-o024","basis":"赤壁交战前"},"evidence":["xianzhu-e-p028a-q","xianzhu-q-o024","wudi-q-o119","wudi-q-b-888495d8be7766faf20c"]},"source_order":[32,135,"P028a"],"order":6541}],"persons":[{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0172","name":"关羽","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0367","name":"张飞","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhou-yu","name":"周瑜","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-q-b-888495d8be7766faf20c","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-888495d8be7766faf20c","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十三年：建安十三年（公元 208）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":666,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-0bae348fdb687025113d","start":0,"end":21},{"id":"wudi-q-o119","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4bcffcc4ee709a4e5ea3","layer":"original","quote":"十三年春正月〖1〗，公还邺。作玄武池以肄舟师〖2〗。﹝一﹞汉罢三公官，置丞相、御史大夫〖3〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":661,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47},{"id":"xianzhu-e-p028a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-ac932db2f7519b5b89fa","layer":"pei","quote":"《江表传》曰：“备从鲁肃计，进住鄂县之樊口。诸葛亮诣吴，未还。备闻曹公军下，恐惧；日遣逻吏于水次，候望权军。吏望见瑜船，驰往白备。备曰：‘何以知之非青、徐军邪？’吏对曰：‘以船知之。’备遣人慰劳之。瑜曰：‘有军任，不可得委署；傥能屈威，诚副其所望。’备谓关羽、张飞曰：‘彼欲致我；我今自结托于东，而不往：非同盟之意也。’乃乘单舸，往见瑜，问曰：‘今拒曹公，深为得计。战卒有几？’瑜曰：‘三万人。’备曰：‘恨少！’瑜曰：‘此自足用，豫州但观瑜破之！’备欲呼鲁肃等共会语，瑜曰：‘受命，不得妄委署；若欲见子敬，可别过之。又孔明已俱来，不过三两日到也。’备虽深愧异瑜，而心未许之能必破北军也；故差池在后，将二千人与羽、飞俱，未肯系瑜：盖为进退之计也。”","attribution":"《江表传》","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":134,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-fa2b1b8270a0e0f5044d","start":3,"end":326},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o024","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-c857386227851cc86ab3","layer":"original","quote":"（曹公南征表）〔及曹公南征〕，会表卒，﹝二﹞子琮代立〖2〗，遣使请降。先主屯樊，不知曹公猝至；至宛乃闻之，遂将其众去。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":108,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":59},{"id":"xianzhu-q-p028-sunsheng","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-ac932db2f7519b5b89fa","layer":"pei","quote":"孙盛曰：“刘备雄才，处必亡之地，告急于吴，而获奔助；无缘复顾望江渚而怀后计。《江表传》之言，当是吴人欲专美之辞。”","attribution":"孙盛评论","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":134,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-fa2b1b8270a0e0f5044d","start":326,"end":383}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
